# GFA BASIC 3.5E (ST Format's cover disk, drive B, unmodified): a two-line
# program typed into its editor and run (Shift F10): LPRINT a line of text,
# then HARDCOPY, GFA's screen dump. The launcher starts
# B:\GFABASIC\GFABASIC.PRG (make_launcher.py). `type` presses " where the TOS's keyboard has it.
@printer
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/launchers/gfabasic.st
@disk-b $PROGRAM_DISKS/gfa_basic_3_5e/files/gfa_basic_3_5e_st_format.msa
wait 100
key 0x01
wait 1200
type 'lprint "gfa basic lprint test"\n'
type hardcopy
key 0x1c
wait 25
shot program
printwatch
keydown 0x2a
key 0x44
keyup 0x2a
printer 100 3000
shot after
